    eyebrow="Edmonton · Motion + 3D"
    h1="Motion and 3D in Edmonton. <em>Delivered with intent.</em>"
    intro="KR8TIV creates motion graphics, 3D animation and cinematic sequences for brands in Edmonton, across Alberta and Canada. Motion and 3D work starts from $750 CAD, made directly with Matt Haynes for websites, launches, social posts and screens."
